rooms_desc ({"You are in the entrance to Dalmore's flat, to the north you can see the flat proper with the quiet sounds of music drifting to you. The walls arecovered in wooden panels and lend a dreamy quality to the place","You have entered the main living area, soft music is playing in the backgroundand a large television takes up the north-western corner of the room.A well stocked bar takes up the entire eastern wall, and a door south leads to the bedroom.","In the center of the room is a large four-poster bed, and around it lie severalpotted plants. A door leads east onto a balcony and a large bay window letsin the moonlight. An open fire fills the room with warmth and a rug liesbefore it, to the side of the fireplace is a coal scuttle.","You enter the balcony outside of the bedroom, you first notice themoor spreading out before you, tall granite mountains leading down intoa deep loch. You can feel the wind blowing through the air and the moon lendseverything a strange poetic feel to the land.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
